<title>CANADA: Power Financial okays 2 for 1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Power Financial okays 2 for 1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Power Financial Corp said on Wednesday that its board of directors approved a two-for-one stock split of its common shares.</p>
<p>A special meeting of the common shareholders was called for December 23 at which they will be asked to approve the stock split, the company said.</p>
<p>The proposed stock split, if approved, would increase the number of common shares outstanding to 171,578,926 from 85,789,463.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
</text>
